<title>GTA6未获准中国销售，R星仍在抖音宣传；网传直播指引血液改绿《GTA6》11月19日全球发售，该系列从未获准在中国大陆</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10541</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10541</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 02:34:02 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>GTA6未获准中国销售，R星仍在抖音宣传；网传直播指引血液改绿</b><br/><br/>《GTA6》11月19日全球发售，该系列从未获准在中国大陆销售。据游民星空报道，抖音知名主播女流66开播不久直播间便疑似遭封禁。<br/><br/>游民星空此前披露，抖音主播群流出未公开的直播合规引导，禁止严重伤害和暴露着装画面，并建议用“色盲模式”把红色血液改成绿色。有外媒指，中国规定平台不应直播未获批游戏，若指引落实，主播或被迫避开构成GTA特色的内容（据称指引禁止偷车、攻击平民、与警察打斗）。<br/><br/>据路透社报道，R星正通过抖音认证账号向数十万中国粉丝宣传，R星与国家新闻出版署均未回应置评。《南华早报》视频提到，深圳游戏顾问称当局对玩家经外区商店购买“睁一只眼闭一只眼”；一名中国玩家说，没有正版引进，“你反而可以很自由地玩这个游戏”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F">#游戏</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5">#审查</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《游民星空》<a href="https://www.gamersky.com/news/202611/2246244.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">抖音发布《GTA6》直播规范：大尺度内容要遮挡</a><br/>《南华早报》<a href="https://www.scmp.com/video/lifestyle/3375106/why-grand-theft-auto-vi-might-succeed-mainland-china-despite-sales-ban" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Why Grand Theft Auto VI might succeed in mainland China despite a sales ban（为何《GTA6》未获准销售，仍可能在中国大陆成功）</a><br/>《路透社》<a href="https://www.reuters.com/technology/rockstar-promotes-gta-vi-china-despite-lack-sales-approval-2026-11-18/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Rockstar promotes GTA VI in China despite lack of sales approval（R星未获销售批准，仍在中国宣传《GTA6》）</a><br/>《新闻周刊》<a href="https://www.newsweek.com/entertainment/gta-6-sex-violence-crashing-china-censorship-rules-12732758" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">GTA 6&#39;s Sex &amp; Violence Is Crashing Into China&#39;s Censorship Rules（GTA6的性与暴力撞上中国审查规则）</a><br/>《游民星空》<a href="https://www.gamersky.com/news/202611/2248967.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">《GTA6》开播没多久就出事！女流直播间疑似被封禁</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/cGgXYv-HYQoUAXHW2sApiwCbmkROGsPbUn5sfqQnL3jMuMwKILQZE-NHgzQ6IvgxYXngNs0eSD0oNV3aPkw_Q3SzWuNAaUTtxYZf8l7FIfwb_AwQ8kzHFJMwY1xD1-1X2h42UkOMnHZWQt3BmO2mzjtW1cBhbz5K6H5tI8CuKSlM_3vhqnupw8GQc8lvMOw3hviZrjaV6R-JWC4pa-6o6vbhRjtuJt51EoLqlR700fxu_3EDJb5fwXqgEi9JVBDJgkzO8EcEC8yBNq8wGGpO-NxkrZYCksha7VgjUdNK0pNU4phgSnMDzCOY2kx54mpsg7iI-LCOI8YKu1JBVmueug.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/otmplxcEl3sIvLC8T-vgb9Rtbzb5X6dDelSpeJoZo5M_FiuawuFzcU2323nXPUKqGXU182oM-TYfsmVQ5DCFw4s8-38WS_mEz2uWhiQfZPc2WpC-zJh13L8t18eDQ5B_ZUUJCZu6BO9kiw7vAU7p6iQ3jBgwS3JEvZN9-PfVp3oW_tFKsyjBMJerGI7FEHO1KopJFbKygh8SZPE6ZLBNDCGu0ms46itrcj0_47UWkNJ6EeCY4OlTdYL8J2XZQUCcG_VLfTnRSA4NL5cTWixHJZcnuCB46-vGYiMbgmxT0ajZFSVMnlBPX_iUdyjYIjZy7-UQc1LW63IHRjA_tSFnqw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/QbBTjzs-eteBa_k7832nwCDkQTy5jcf-SszUOIWJ8MEDGaF2vt7LF688FdffNI8gArk9IGk-bW3Ej0f9yM6Z5Q76ujKeMZPHI-kUNddMY9oyUIlpNSkU7I9EcqEenbhAQp-6Zf3e_6i8oMNxL_rWkslQWkWvUbWnbhkEKlSt8aV8ED0q7UpqoJdWpgpLqNb5nvWnO5x2K75umvH5sWhGdza5fNkcm6USi6ppKHh1zoJBpsYU2mT1czyI86iDC3PaUEevfgob4DkIU4P1nLiX0QoPEbWCpFCD_TmiaoGT82U08ogk2hqKD1uhLHExnkScGpA-29-3SNLfJNd6RbNrBQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/LUwb5Db_0HFUvTQ4dA7E5zyEhr4gOOl6J7lqxYq1dzooWof5Nfa2JJRfwXEb-_WU5gXp4T9c8IsvtsPvL1XdQJhUOBVJEF-9sgn-HNFn6bLdOhnEZo1lLc4O9MLJdOc6Rbsbmz7hqi-B7C_hE59YBj023ClI_dnHzbodsWVLOVTzDV2w5NcgNHSEoFrDmofDLEHUtv7C_wv74fNjpsmTg0C4DJRr9V6Jqucq2mmFMZ79Y6r1LPiIBni5LYnQ2KC33-xGwiDJK3USQMyZUi6SAb3vGeMv1QzzcZZM6GKtkQrAHUVTqGfuxzF3Xx0C7_362iNuZItF3BHoUlmZt84VJg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img